cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below, and cite the PhysioNet EEGMMIDB dataset."
title: "eeg-alpha-bench: a reproducible eyes-open / eyes-closed alpha (Berger effect) benchmark for EEG devices"
abstract: >-
  Python package and CLI that tests whether an EEG setup detects the Berger effect
  (posterior alpha increase with eyes closed), returning PASS / FAIL / INCONCLUSIVE with
  pre-registered thresholds. Validated on 109 subjects of the PhysioNet EEG Motor
  Movement/Imagery Dataset.
type: software
authors:
